  h2:'The six buttons at the bottom',
  dock:[['◉ Assess','pulse · monitor · history · exam · 12-lead · unstable signs'],['✚ CPR &amp; Airway','compressions · oxygen · bag-mask · tube · ETCO₂'],['ϟ Defib / Pacer','pads, then shock in 4 numbered steps · pacing'],['℞ Med cart','1 access → 2 drug → type the dose → give'],['⊞ Investigate','labs (one tap) · ultrasound · Hs &amp; Ts · call an expert'],['↗ Handover','finish the case and open the debrief']],
